@post_election_menu

- @congress_3
- @congress_4
- @congress_5

@congress_3
title: Begin the congress...
view-if: soviet_elections = 3
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.soviet_elections += 1;
  Q.coalition1 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_soviet + Q.maximalist_soviet + Q.b_soviet + (Q.lsr_soviet * 0.9) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.5)))/100; 
  Q.coalition2 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_soviet + Q.maximalist_soviet + Q.b_soviet + Q.lsr_soviet + (Q.other_soviet * 0.8) + (Q.sdi_soviet * 0.3)))/100; 
  Q.coalition3 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_soviet + Q.maximalist_soviet + Q.b_soviet + Q.lsr_soviet + (Q.other_soviet * 0.8) + (Q.sdi_soviet * 0.5) + (Q.left_m_soviet * 0.4)))/100; 
  Q.coalition4 = Math.round(100*((Q.b_soviet * (Q.leninist_strength / (Q.leninist_strength + Q.leftcom_strength))) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.5) + (Q.sdi_soviet * 0.2) + (Q.left_m_soviet * 0.4)))/100;
  
  Q.coalition5 = Math.round(100*((Q.anarchist_soviet * 0.5) + (Q.maximalist_soviet * 0.8) + Q.b_soviet + (Q.lsr_soviet * 0.9) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.8) + (Q.left_m_soviet * 0.1) + (Q.sdi_soviet * 0.1)))/100; 
  Q.coalition6 = Math.round(100*((Q.anarchist_soviet * 0.5) + (Q.maximalist_soviet * 0.9) + Q.b_soviet + (Q.lsr_soviet * 0.8) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.7)))/100; 
  Q.coalition7 = Math.round(100*((Q.anarchist_soviet * 0.6) + (Q.maximalist_soviet * 1) + Q.b_soviet + (Q.lsr_soviet * 1) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.6) + (Q.sr_soviet * 0.5) + (Q.left_m_soviet * 0.2) + (Q.sdi_soviet * 0.2)))/100; 
  Q.coalition8 = Math.round(100*((Q.maximalist_soviet * 0.2) + (Q.b_soviet * (Q.moderate_strength / (Q.moderate_strength + Q.leninist_strength))) + (Q.lsr_soviet * 0.1) + (Q.sr_soviet * 0.9) + (Q.right_sr_soviet * 0.8) + (Q.left_m_soviet * 1) + (Q.m_soviet * 1) + (Q.right_m_soviet * 1) + (Q.sdi_soviet) + (Q.popular_socialist_soviet * 0.1) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.5)))/100; 
  Q.coalition9 = Math.round(100*((Q.lsr_soviet * 0.3) + (Q.sr_soviet) + (Q.right_sr_soviet) + (Q.left_m_soviet * 1) + (Q.m_soviet * 1) + (Q.right_m_soviet * 1) + (Q.sdi_soviet) + (Q.popular_socialist_soviet) + (Q.other_soviet * 0.3)))/100; 
!}

As expected, the Congress of Soviets is much more amenable to our party than the Constituent Assembly, and should hopefully approve the latter's dissolution. 


@congress_4
title: Begin the congress...
view-if: soviet_elections = 4

@congress_5
title: Begin the congress...
view-if: soviet_elections = 5



@congress_3_menu

- #congress3_decisions

@cec_election3
title: Elect a new Central Executive Committee...
max-visits: 1
tags: congress3_decisions
go-to: cec_election3_menu

@cec_election3_menu
on-arrival: cec_election3_seen = 1

We prepare to create a new CEC, which is roughly proportional to the party composition at the Congress. Who shall be elected as chairman? 

- @3_sverdlov
- @3_kamenev
- @3_spiridonova
- @3_martov
- @3_chernov


@3_kamenev
title: Lev Kamenev (<span style="color: var(--b);">Bolshevik — Moderate</span>)
subtitle: [+ coalition5 +]% – This would prop-up the remaining Moderates. 
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition5 +]% – This would prop-up the remaining Moderates. 
choose-if: coalition5 > 50
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.soviet_chair = "Kamenev";
  Q.soviet_chair_party = "Bolshevik";
  Q.moderate_strength += 10; Q.leninist_strength -= 3; Q.leftcom_strength -= 3;
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 5;
!}

@3_sverdlov
title: Yakov Sverdlov (<span style="color: var(--b);">Bolshevik — Leninist</span>)
subtitle: [+ coalition6 +]% – This is considered the default choice. 
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition6 +]% – This is considered the default choice. 
choose-if: coalition6 > 50
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.soviet_chair = "Sverdlov";
  Q.soviet_chair_party = "Bolshevik";
  Q.moderate_strength -= 5; Q.leninist_strength += 10; 
  Q.moderate_dissent += 5; Q.leninist_dissent -= 5;
!}

@3_spiridonova
title: Maria Spiridonova (<span style="color: var(--lsr);">Left-SR</span>)
subtitle: [+ coalition7 +]% – This would shore up our alliance, but cede considerable leverage. 
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition7 +]% – This would shore up our alliance, but cede considerable leverage. 
choose-if: coalition7 > 50
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.soviet_chair = "Spiridonova";
  Q.soviet_chair_party = "Left-SR";
  Q.lsr_strength += 10; Q.lsr_relation += 10; 
  Q.leninist_strength -= 5; Q.moderate_strength += 2; Q.leftcom_strength += 5;
  Q.leninist_dissent += 5; Q.moderate_dissent -= 2; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 5;
!}

@3_martov
title: Iulius Martov (<span style="color: var(--m);">Menshevik – Internationalist</span>)
subtitle: [+ coalition8 +]% – The opposition puts forth their preferred candidate. 
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition8 +]% – The opposition puts forth their preferred candidate. 
choose-if: coalition8 > 50
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.soviet_chair = "Martov";
  Q.soviet_chair_party = "Menshevik";
  Q.left_m_strength += 10; Q.m_strength += 5; Q.right_m_strength -= 2;
  Q.left_m_relation += 5; 
  Q.leninist_strength -= 10; Q.moderate_strength += 5; Q.leftcom_strength += 2;
  Q.leninist_dissent += 10; Q.moderate_dissent -= 5; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 2;
!}

@3_chernov
title: Viktor Chernov (<span style="color: var(--sr);">SR – Centre</span>)
subtitle: [+ coalition9 +]% – The right-wing has a protest candidate in mind. 
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition9 +]% – The right-wing has a protest candidate in mind. 
choose-if: coalition9 > 50
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.soviet_chair = "Chernov";
  Q.soviet_chair_party = "SR";
  Q.sr_strength += 10; Q.right_sr_strength += 5; 
  Q.sr_relation += 5; 
  Q.leninist_strength -= 10; Q.moderate_strength += 5; Q.leftcom_strength -= 5;
  Q.leninist_dissent += 10; Q.moderate_dissent -= 5; Q.leftcom_dissent += 5;
!}



@dissolve_ca
title: Affirm the dissolution of the Constituent Assembly. 
subtitle: [+ coalition1 +]% – Ratify the decision and expunge all references to the Assembly. 
max-visits: 1
choose-if: coalition1 > 50
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition1 +]% – We lack the votes for this. 
tags: congress3_decisions
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.democraticity += 1; Q.ca_support_timer -= 1;
  Q.leninist_strength += 5; Q.leftcom_strength += 3; Q.moderate_strength -= 5;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 2; Q.soldiers_unrest -= 2; Q.peasants_unrest -= 2; 
!}

The dissolution of the Constituent Assembly is approved. 

@declaration
title: Approve the "Declaration of the Rights of the Working and Exploited People".  
subtitle: [+ coalition2 +]% – This will serve as a foundational document for the new republic. 
max-visits: 1
tags: congress3_decisions
choose-if: coalition2 > 50
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition2 +]% – We lack the votes for this. 
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.democraticity += 1; 
  Q.leninist_strength += 5; Q.leftcom_strength += 3; 
  Q.workers_unrest -= 5; Q.soldiers_unrest -= 5; Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; 
!}

The declaration is approved. 

@constitution
title: Formally declare a "Soviet Republic", and charge the CEC with drafting a constitution. 
subtitle: [+ coalition3 +]% – We will create a system based around soviet power. 
max-visits: 1
tags: congress3_decisions
choose-if: coalition3 > 50
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition3 +]% – We lack the votes for this. 
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.democraticity += 2; Q.instability -= 1;
  Q.constitution_progress = 1;
!}

The proposal for a new constitution is approved. 

@peace_treaty
title: Present a peace treaty for the Congress to approve. 
subtitle: [+ coalition4 +]% – This will formalize the agreement with Germany. 
max-visits: 1
tags: congress3_decisions
choose-if: coalition4 > 50
unavailable-subtitle: [+ coalition4 +]% – [?if coalition4 <= 50 : We lack the votes for this. ?][?if brest_signed != 1 : We have no peace treaty to present. ?]
go-to: congress_3_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.democraticity -= 1; Q.instability -= 5; 
  Q.war_weariness -= 10; Q.disillusionment -= 0.5; 
!}

The peace treaty is approved. 

@conclude
title: Conclude the congress...
max-visits: 1
tags: congress3_decisions
choose-if: cec_election3_seen = 1
go-to: root

The Congress of Soviets ends and the delegates head home, entrusting governance to the Central Executive Committee they selected. 
